## Lucide
https://lucide.dev — ISC License
Icon path data (`shapes`) is sourced from the Lucide icon set.

Generated icons (`generated-icons.ts`) are extracted from `lucide-static@1.31.0`
(pinned exact, no `^` — see package.json devDependencies and the header of
scripts/generate-lucide-icons.ts). Pinned exact on purpose: Lucide's geometry
changes between versions (new icons, retouched paths, renames), and
regenerating the catalog should be a deliberate act (manual version bump +
review), never a side effect of an unrelated `npm install`.

